###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#NetworkTrafficObject
stones:NetworkTrafficObject rdfs:subClassOf stonework:NetworkTraffic .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#Note
stones:Note rdfs:subClassOf stonework:Note .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#objectMarkingRefs
stones:objectMarkingRefs rdfs:subPropertyOf stonework:markingRef .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#ObservedData
stones:ObservedData rdfs:subClassOf stonework:DigitalArtifact .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#Opinion
stones:Opinion rdfs:subClassOf stonework:Information .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#ProcessObject
stones:ProcessObject rdfs:subClassOf stonework:RuntimeProcess .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#related_to
stones:related_to rdfs:subPropertyOf stonework:relatedTo .

###  https://cyberterrain.org/ns/stones#Report
