stonex:_dropper owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeDropper .
stonex:_exploit-kit owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeExploitKit .
stonex:_keylogger owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeKeylogger .
stonex:_ransomware owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeRansomware .
stonex:_remote-access-trojan owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeRAT .
stonex:_resource-exploitation owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeResourceExploitation .
stonex:_rootkit owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeRootkit .
stonex:_screen-capture owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeScreenCapture .
stonex:_spyware owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeSpyware .
stonex:_trojan owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeTrojan .
stonex:_virus owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeVirus .
stonex:_webshell owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeWebshell .
stonex:_wiper owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeWiper .
stonex:_worm owl:sameAs stonework:malwareTypeWorm .


